{"channelId":"UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","row":["ARL BerksCo",1620,"The Animal Rescue League of Berks County is a charitable 501c3 organization caring for nearly 5,000 animals each year to help them find second chances in a new home, or to help reunite them with their grateful owners. For more than 65 years, we’ve worked tirelessly to care for the sick, treat the injured, comfort the unwanted and protect the abused. Whether helping people in need keep their pets through surrender prevention programs, offering low-cost veterinary services and clinics, as well as outreach and education events throughout the county, our work goes far beyond the walls of the shelter.","info@berksarl.org; abudock@berksarl.org; admissions@berksarl.org; adoption@berksarl.org; animalprotection@berksarl.org; foster@berksarl.org; medical@berksarl.org; volunteer@berksarl.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:11.882Z","channelId":"UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"fd167cfed7ea631de6abcef3ebfac904653bb3e7edfc0b5ef0c94c2a98cefd60","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d926460dc33c46f99b6df7836b3f5e50ca29572f48fe85d305eb8a1649bf049c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:34:27.597Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1620,"raw":"1.62K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCD4ysq-o1G8mukQC8knl5vA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:11.882Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@berksarl.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://berksarl.org/contact_us/","https://berksarl.org/about/"],"evidenceIds":["pu